5
00:00:17,475 --> 00:00:21,185
Did you say, "Call Temple Beth Seder"?

6
00:00:22,439 --> 00:00:24,769
(Leonard:)- No.
- Here, let me try.

7
00:00:25,442 --> 00:00:29,532
Call M'kflono M'kflooniloo. Ha-ha. Ha.

8
00:00:30,196 --> 00:00:32,326
